  "slug": "victory-of-the-antelope",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/3996_victory-of-the-antelope.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Two antelopes were grazing on the grassland when a cheetah suddenly charged toward the young one. “Run!” the older antelope shouted. Hearing his father’s warning, the young antelope raced away. His father guided him as they ran, and although the cheetah was fast, it never caught up with them.",
    "When they reached a safe place, they stopped. The young antelope asked his father, “Why did we run? We could have fought the cheetah!” The older antelope smiled. “If we had fought it, we would only have become its dinner sooner. When we face a cheetah, we have to admit defeat and run if we want to win in the end. Winning doesn’t mean knocking it down. It means running faster than it can!”",
    "When facing a powerful enemy, only by being willing to admit defeat and doing your best to escape can you have a chance at a victory of your own."
  ],
  "english_full": "Two antelopes were grazing on the grassland when a cheetah suddenly charged toward the young one. “Run!” the older antelope shouted. Hearing his father’s warning, the young antelope raced away. His father guided him as they ran, and although the cheetah was fast, it never caught up with them.\n\nWhen they reached a safe place, they stopped. The young antelope asked his father, “Why did we run? We could have fought the cheetah!” The older antelope smiled. “If we had fought it, we would only have become its dinner sooner. When we face a cheetah, we have to admit defeat and run if we want to win in the end. Winning doesn’t mean knocking it down. It means running faster than it can!”\n\nWhen facing a powerful enemy, only by being willing to admit defeat and doing your best to escape can you have a chance at a victory of your own.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Две антило́пы паслись на лугу, когда вдруг гепа́рд ринулся к молодой антило́пе. \"Беги!\" — закричала ста́рая антило́па. Слыша́ жени́ного предупрежде́ния, молодая антило́па побежала прочь. Её ба́тька веди́л её, пока они́ бегли, и хоть гепа́рд был ско́рым, он никогда́ не успел их догнать.",
    "Когда они́ до́шли до безопа́сного ме́ста, они́ останови́лись. Молодая антило́па спро́сила своего ба́тьку: \"Почему́ мы беги́ли? Мы могли́ бы срази́ться с гепа́рдом!\" Ста́рая антило́па улыбну́лась. \"Если бы мы срази́лись, мы только́ стали́ бы его у́жином скорее. Когда мы стыка́емся с гепа́рдом, мы должны́ допуска́ть пораже́ние и убега́ть, если хотим вы́играть в конце́ концо́в. Побе́да не значи́т, что нужно его свали́ть. Это значи́т бегать ско́рее, чем он может!\"",
    "Когда ты столкнёшься с могу́щественным врагом, только́ призна́в свои́ пораже́ния и делая всё возмо́жное, чтобы сбежать, ты име́ешь шанс на свою́ побе́ду."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Dve antilópy paslis' na lugu, kogda vdrug gepárd rinulsya k molodoy antilópe. \"Begí!\" — zakrichala stáraya antilópa. Slyshá zhenínogo preduprézheniya, molodaya antilópa pobézhala próch'. Yeyó bátyka vedíl yeyo, poka oní begli, i khot' gepárd byl skórym, on nikogdá ne uspel ikh dógnat'.",
    "Kogda oní dóshli do bezopásnogo mésta, oní Ostanóvилиs'. Molodaya Antilópa sprósila svoego bátyku: \"Pochemú my begíli? My moglí by srazí́t'sya s gepárdom!\" Stáraya antilópa ulybnúlas'. \"Eslí by my srazí́lis', my tol'kó stadém yego úzhinom skorée. Kogda my stykáemsya s gepárdom, my dolzhný dopuskát' porazhenie i ubégát', esli khotim výigrat' v koncé kontsóv. Pobéda ne znachít, chto nuzhno ego svalít'. Eto znachít begat' skóree, chem on mozhét!\"",
    "Kogda ty stolknësh'sya s mogúchestvennym vragom, tol'ko priznav porazheniya i delaya vsyo vozmózhnoe, chtoby sbézhat', ty iméesh shans na svoyu pobédu."
  ],
